<title>USA: North American stake cut by Cooperman.</title>
<headline>North American stake cut by Cooperman.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor Leon Cooperman said Tuesday he cut his stake in North American Mortgage Corp to 592,800 common shares or 4.2 percent from 6.2 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cooperman said his latest transactions include the sale of 327,400 common shares between Sept 13 and Nov 8 at prices ranging from $17.46 to $21.80.</p>
<p>The balance of the stake continues to be held for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
